# Zonerider

!!#L#3D# **Zonerider** is a 3D editor a little like Blender. Model with shapes and vertices, add light, animate with keyframes, render images and videos, and export glTF, OBJ and STL!

[Open Zonerider](/zonerider) · [Phone version](/zonerider/mobile/)


::divider{wavy|Zonerider|lime}
## What you can do

* **Model**: start from shapes and edit their vertices!
* **Light and shade**: add lights, and write your own shaders!
* **Animate**: set keyframes and play them back!
* **Render** still images and videos!
* **Export** glTF, OBJ and STL, for other 3D tools or 3D printing!

The **Help** menu explains 3D scenes, shaders and animation!

## 3D scenes in documents

Writeout and Bitbook can embed a Zonerider scene, so a document can hold a 3D model people can turn around. In Bitbook it is under **Insert > 3D Scene**. Zonerider runs in a small *embed* mode for this!
